ase randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nThe office on Friday fills with relaxation and joy, everyone discusses their weekend plans. The project manager hopes everyone shares their plans, welcoming the upcoming weekend with a positive attitude. Lina speaks first: \"I plan to enjoy a peaceful weekend, and catch up on some sleep.\" She then asks Minghao: \"What about you, Minghao, do you have any special plans for the weekend?\" Minghao smiles and answers: \"I want to go cycling in the countryside, breathe some fresh air.\" The project manager agrees: \"That's a good idea. I plan to take my family to the beach.\"\n\n[Question]\nIf there is, which sentence is inappropriate?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. No one says anything inappropriate.\nB. That's a good idea. I plan to take my family to the beach.\nC. I want to go cycling in the countryside, breathe some fresh air.\nD. I plan to enjoy a peaceful weekend, and catch up on some sleep.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0011694782996089484,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e49cd6006945d2808482","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794368668481,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:44:28","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"7e962d9f037b4204b5ffaaa9add63d2d"}